%% Regenerate (from the repo root):
%%   mmdc -i docs/assets/flow.mmd -c docs/assets/flow.config.json -o docs/assets/flow.svg -b white
%%   mmdc -i docs/assets/flow.mmd -c docs/assets/flow.config.json -o docs/assets/flow.png -b white -w 1400 -s 2
flowchart TB
    subgraph ALL["EVERY SESSION: run_state.json + continuation state vector are updated, so any usage limit is survivable"]
        direction TB
        S0["`**S0  Orientation**
Know the journey; jot down your life plan and study interests
*Output: your notes*`"]

        subgraph PRE["PREAMBLE (S1 + S2): locked once passed; changed only by an explicit amend-plan"]
            direction TB
            S1["`**S1  Life and Career Plan**  (interview with Virgil)
**Why:** every programme is scored against YOUR life, money and constraints
*Output: your life plan*`"]
            G1{{"`**GATE:** must pass before search`"}}
            S2["`**S2  Study and Pathway Map**  (interview + benchmark scout)
**Why:** defines what fit means: what you will learn, and the people, labs, industry partners and internships that lead where you want
*Output: pathway map + 3 benchmark examples*`"]
            G2{{"`**GATE:** must pass before search`"}}
            S1 --> G1 --> S2 --> G2
        end

        S3["`**S3  Scope and Agent Brief**
**Why:** decides which countries, how deep, and what funded means
*Output: search plan + agent brief*`"]

        S4["`**S4 to S6  Search waves**  (one research agent per country)
Path A: programme-first.  Path B: people- and partner-first.
Saves a JSON file after every record, so nothing is lost
*Output: one file per country*`"]

        S7["`**S7  Triage**
Follow-ups where gaps matter; stop where the answer cannot change; cross-country funding scans`"]

        S8["`**S8  Merge and Verify**
Scripts merge and score; an independent agent fact-checks a sample`"]

        S9["`**S9  Deliverables**
**Options Rundown** (your decision document)
**Due-Diligence One-Pager** (proof of breadth and verification)`"]

        S0 --> S1
        G2 --> S3 --> S4 --> S7 --> S8 --> S9

        PAUSE(["`**Usage limit hit at any point?**
Stop safely: nothing is lost.
A new chat reads run_state.json`"])
        S4 -.-> PAUSE
        PAUSE -. "resume from files" .-> S4
    end

    classDef step fill:#EAF2F8,stroke:#1F4E79,stroke-width:2px,color:#14213D;
    classDef gate fill:#FFF4D6,stroke:#7A5200,stroke-width:2px,color:#3D2A00;
    classDef out fill:#E3F4EA,stroke:#1E6B3A,stroke-width:2px,color:#0F3320;
    classDef loop fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#4B3A8C,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 4,color:#241A4D;
    class S0,S1,S2,S3,S4,S7,S8 step;
    class G1,G2 gate;
    class S9 out;
    class PAUSE loop;
    style PRE fill:#F4F7FA,stroke:#1F4E79,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#14213D
    style ALL fill:#F8F6FC,stroke:#4B3A8C,stroke-width:2px,color:#241A4D
    linkStyle 9,10 stroke:#4B3A8C,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 4
